 "text": "Hi! How are you doing these days? Nice of them. Would you rather they stay with you or at a hotel? Definitely. A little bit of both. A few snacks in the freezer for fresh ones, and a full water pitcher. A note is good. Also, tell them who else uses the room, like you and the kids, so they don't think it's spooky. Lovely. A small bouquet from the front door would be welcome and not expensive. If you don't know the size of the guests, stick to small ones that only need water once a week.",
